  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization of a contest of business projects in the area of circular economy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project plans to engage an external contractor to organize the Contest in accordance with the requirements of the legislation of the Republic of Belarus, conduct events to promote information about the Contest terms and conditions to potential participants, create tools for collecting applications from potential participants, and organize offline events with project presentations and award ceremonies. The purpose of the project initiation plan is to describe the activities required to organize and conduct the Contest.</narrative>
  </description>
